# First-run object-store credential bootstrap (composition.rs's
# CREDENTIAL_BOOTSTRAP_FILE). It belongs in the app data directory, never
# in the repository -- this entry exists so a stray copy cannot be
# committed by accident. See ADR-CRED-001.
credentials.json
